  "Id": 1665,
  "Title": "AKU faculty awarded Sitara-i-Imtiaz",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "The award recognises Dr Shaista Khan's achievements in the health sciences.",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClass7233F79B101C49249BBA0181CE2BD117\"><p>\u200bProfessor Shaista Masood Khan has been conferred the Sitara-i-Imtiaz in recognition of her achievements in the area of health sciences.&#160;</p><p>A renowned surgeon who has been affiliated with AKU since 1986, Dr Shaista Khan also serves as the head of the section of breast surgery at AKU.&#160;</p><p>Dr Khan completed her MBBS from Dow Medical College in 1972 and was awarded a fellowship of The Royal College of Surgeons of Edinburgh, UK.&#160;<br></p></div>",
